# THE STANDING FLOOR OF A FALLEN TOWER IN GREEN TOWERS (docs/interiors, src/content/interiors/rooted_floor.gd):
# the storeys above came down, this one stood, and the forest came up through it:
# a trunk out of a break in the slab and out of a hole in the ceiling, roots over
# the concrete, moss and ferns, vines hanging; a fire on a stone, a sleeping
# platform woven up off the floor, a basin under the drip.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/rooted.tour --seed=4 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is the shell as a player finds it among the trees. 02 is the floor from
# above as the player comes in. 03 is the same at night by the fire. 04 is over
# the shoulder, up the trunk to the day.
coast calm
near door:rooted_floor
await door 5
wait 0.6
shot 01-a-fallen-tower-standing-in-the-forest with door,land:green_towers

press use 0.1
await inside:rooted_floor 5
wait 1.0
shot 02-the-rooted-floor-from-above-by-day with inside:rooted_floor

near fire
hour 22
wait 1.0
shot 03-the-rooted-floor-by-its-fire-at-night with inside:rooted_floor,station:fire

hour 15
wait 0.6
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
mouse 300,0 0.6
wait 0.6
shot 04-up-the-trunk-over-the-shoulder with inside:rooted_floor,shoulder
